UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54232186050635
DTSTART:20261023T120000Z
DTEND:20261024T040000Z
DESCRIPTION:Florida State Alternative Breaks is a student-led service and leadership program that provides immersive community engagement experiences during academic breaks. Through meaningful service\, education\, and reflection\, students explore new communities\, build lasting relationships\, and develop the skills needed to create positive change in their communities. \n\nCamp Boggy Creek offers free\, medically safe experiences for children with serious illnesses to experience joy and happiness in a camp setting. Join one of our spring trips to the camp located near Orlando to serve at an upcoming family retreat weekend.
GEO:30.441189;-84.29835
LOCATION:Dunlap Success Center (DSC)\, 1100
SUMMARY:FSAB - Camp Boggy Creek
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.fsu.edu/event/fsab-camp-boggy-creek
CATEGORIES:Special Events
END:VEVENT
