DTEND:20261027T230000Z
DESCRIPTION:Come to the Haunted Hall of Leadership if you dare! Teams of four students will progress through two sequential escape rooms that will require students to use teamwork to solve problems. Feel free to come in a costume\, and candy will be provided! The event will contain working exits at all times should students need to leave and will be supervised by staff.
GEO:30.441189;-84.29835
LOCATION:Dunlap Success Center (DSC)\, 2201
SUMMARY:Haunted Hall of Leadership
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.fsu.edu/event/haunted-hall-of-leadership
CATEGORIES:Special Events
END:VEVENT
