DTSTART:20261103T180000Z
DTEND:20261103T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Purpose Project is designed to help students cultivate well-being and a strong sense of belonging through a community-centered approach. In today's world\, students face stressors that affect both individuals and their communities\, including natural disasters\, climate change\, political and social polarization\, and school violence. The Purpose Project equips students to use resources\, foster supportive relationships\, and thrive together in the face of these challenges.
GEO:30.441189;-84.29835
LOCATION:Dunlap Success Center (DSC)\, 2201
SUMMARY:Overcome Test Anxiety
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.fsu.edu/event/overcome-test-anxiety
CATEGORIES:Academic/Registrar
CATEGORIES:Workshop
END:VEVENT
